1002
01:06:56,220 --> 01:06:57,768
But not so anymore.

1003
01:06:57,848 --> 01:07:00,248
There are secular countries.

1004
01:07:00,328 --> 01:07:07,501
So obviously we grew up believing those things that our textbooks taught us.

1005
01:07:07,581 --> 01:07:08,015
Right?

1006
